      "title": "Python",
      "summary": "The core language, from strings and dictionaries to decorators, generators and async, plus small projects.",
      "how_to_study": "Go through the chapters in numeric order. Every file is a small, runnable script: read it, run it, change the inputs, break it on purpose. When a chapter feels comfortable, try the applied exercises, which combine several concepts into realistic problems. Mental models and write-ups live in [`docs/`](../docs)."
